WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.945
A heavy star, near its end.

00:02.598 --> 00:07.646
Betelgeuse, the red shoulder of Orion, has about fifteen times the Sun's mass.

00:08.130 --> 00:13.317
Heavy stars burn fast: it is only about ten million years old and already near its end.

00:13.788 --> 00:16.408
Put it where the Sun is and it would reach past Jupiter.

00:16.974 --> 00:18.333
One day it will explode.
